summary:
  A reader that met the file's unfinished end is opened again where it stood.

history:
  That is how one end became four: opened again 300 ms back, the reader was
  as near to the writer as before and met the end again a few seconds on.
  A reopen is put the same twelve seconds behind the writer as a resume.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
              shiftPosMs = _openPlace(place - reopenOverlapMs, captured);

replace:
              shiftPosMs = Math.max(0, place - reopenOverlapMs);

expect:
  Killed by tst_timeshiftengine::test_an_end_past_the_capture_reopens_where_the_listener_was.
  Line-neutral.
